   "why": "the largest disagreement between a forward and a backward relaxed scan at the same xi. They should agree: a gap means one direction is trapped in an arrangement the other escapes. A single-direction sweep left the trans end of a prolyl scan 30 kcal/mol high and the error was invisible until the reverse pass was run"
  }
